<title>FRANCE: UAP shares suspended limit down.</title>
<headline>UAP shares suspended limit down.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French insurer UAP were suspended limit down on Thursday morning, the SBF stock market association said.</p>
<p>The shares were suspended at 135 francs and would attempt to requote at 0945 GMT. The new lower limit will be 128.30 francs with the upper limit at 141.70 francs a spokesman for SBF said.</p>
<p>UAP shares closed on November 8 at 116.9 francs. The opening upper and lower limits for the share were readjusted for Thursday's trading due to the issuance of certificates of guaranteed value as part of its merger with Axa, a spokesman for the SBF said.</p>
</text>
